@startuml
title Tabel Referensi - Pengembalian Alat & Ulasan (Jejak Rimba)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam noteBorderColor #4A5568

note as T1
**Tabel Kondisi Alat Saat Dikembalikan**
|===
| Kondisi | Deskripsi | Dampak Stok
| Baik | Alat utuh, fungsi normal | Stok +1, siap disewa
| Rusak Ringan | Cacat kecil, masih pakai | Stok +1, butuh perbaikan
| Rusak Berat | Tidak bisa dipakai | Stok +0, perlu ganti/perbaiki total
| Hilang | Alat tidak dikembalikan | Stok +0, klaim ganti rugi
|===
end note

note as T2
**Tabel Validasi Ulasan**
|===
| Validasi | Syarat | Jika Gagal
| Status Booking | Harus "selesai" | Error: Selesaikan sewa dulu
| Kepemilikan | booking.renter_id = user.id | Error: Akses ditolak
| Duplikat (via booking_id) | Belum ada review untuk booking ini | Error: Ulasan sudah ada
| Duplikat (general) | Belum review alat ini tanpa booking | Error: Ulasan sudah ada
| Rating Range | 1 - 5 | Error: Rating harus 1-5
|===
end note

note as T3
**Tabel Perhitungan Rating**
|===
| Rumus | new_avg = (old_avg * count + new_rating) / (count + 1)
| Update Otomatis | Trigger: insert ke tabel reviews
| Tampil Di | Katalog alat, detail alat, testimoni landing
|===
end note

note as T4
**Tabel Aktor & Tanggung Jawab**
|===
| Aktor | Aktivitas Utama
| Vendor | Verifikasi fisik alat, catat kondisi, setujui pengembalian
| Sistem | Update status, stok, flag ulasan, hitung rating, simpan review
| Pelanggan | Isi rating 1-5 + komentar opsional
|===
end note

note as T5
**Tabel Decision Points**
|===
| Decision Point | Guard True | Guard False
| Booking Selesai? | [Ya] → cek kepemilikan | [Belum] → error
| Milik User? | [Ya] → cek duplikat | [Tidak] → akses ditolak
| Sudah Review? | [Sudah] → error | [Belum] → simpan review
|===
end note

note as T6
**Tabel Entitas Data**
|===
| Entitas | Field Penting
| bookings | id, renter_id, equipment_id, status, end_date
| equipment | id, name, stock, condition
| reviews | id, booking_id, reviewer_id, equipment_id, rating, comment, created_at
| profiles | id, full_name, avatar_url
|===
end note

@enduml